WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500 align:middle line:90%

2
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.980 align:middle line:84%
When a person doesn't have
access to any projects,

3
00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:06.220 align:middle line:84%
they'll see a screen that says
We're setting up your projects.

4
00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:09.280 align:middle line:84%
To fix that, I just need
to give that person access

5
00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:11.110 align:middle line:90%
to the projects we have going.

6
00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:13.120 align:middle line:84%
I'll go to the All
People tab and then

7
00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:16.059 align:middle line:84%
click on the red edit
link under their name.

8
00:00:16.059 --> 00:00:18.610 align:middle line:84%
On the right side, there's
a listing of projects

9
00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:20.220 align:middle line:90%
with checkboxes next to them.

10
00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:23.410 align:middle line:84%
I'll click on the boxes
that I want them to access.

11
00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:27.610 align:middle line:84%
Then click Update project access
at the bottom of this list.

12
00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:28.540 align:middle line:90%
And that's it.

13
00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:32.010 align:middle line:84%
They're now able to log
in and see those projects.
